# FlyRank AI Capstone: Predictive Content Auditing 🚀

A machine learning pipeline designed to predict organic traffic decay and prioritize technical SEO interventions, built during the FlyRank ML-08 Internship.

## 📖 Project Abstract
**Question:** Can we identify high-value content pages that are at risk of traffic decline before the drop impacts top-line business metrics?
**Method:** We engineered a Random Forest classifier using historical search console data (Impressions, CTR, Position) to score pages on their probability of decline, validated against a strictly isolated client holdout set.
**Result:** The model delivers a directional, decision-support queue that flags at-risk pages with a precision of 0.54, outperforming the legacy static rule by 12% and enabling targeted, cost-efficient content refreshes.

